.TH DOOM\-GO\-INJECTOR 1 "2026-10-29" "unheaded b06c570c" "Unheaded Kingdom"
.SH NAME
doom\-go\-injector \- Inject Monad hop\-by\-hop packets into the Doom\-over\-IPv6 compute ring over AF_PACKET.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B doom\-go\-injector
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Inject Monad hop\-by\-hop packets into the Doom\-over\-IPv6 compute ring over AF_PACKET.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-batch \fIN\fR
Packets per burst (burst mode only) (default 100)
.TP
.B \-\-burst\-sleep \fIN\fR
Drain pause between bursts in microseconds (burst mode) (default 50)
.TP
.B \-\-config \fISTRING\fR
Path to TOML config file (e.g. configs/doom.toml)
.TP
.B \-\-count \fIN\fR
Number of packets to inject (0 = infinite, run until Ctrl+C) (default 1000)
.TP
.B \-\-delay \fIN\fR
Inter\-packet delay in microseconds (steady mode only) (default 3000)
.TP
.B \-\-dst\-mac \fISTRING\fR
Destination MAC address (default 02:42:ac:11:00:03)
.TP
.B \-\-flow\-label \fIN\fR
IPv6 flow label (identifies Doom instance) (default 222)
.TP
.B \-\-iface \fISTRING\fR
Network interface to inject on (default veth01)
.TP
.B \-\-mode \fISTRING\fR
Injection mode: steady, burst, fast, sendmmsg (default burst)
.TP
.B \-\-rate \fIN\fR
Injection rate in Hz (overrides \-\-delay, sets mode to steady)
.TP
.B \-\-report\-every \fIN\fR
Log progress every N packets (default 10000)
.TP
.B \-\-src\-mac \fISTRING\fR
Source MAC address (default 02:42:ac:11:00:02)
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
display this help and exit
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
output version information and exit
.SH NOTES
Needs CAP_NET_RAW inside the monad network namespace.
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
sudo ip netns exec monad0 doom\-go\-injector \-\-config configs/doom.toml
doom\-go\-injector \-\-rate 1000
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR unheaded (1)
